  "text": "[NRTM.5.3] Two error codes report transition problems:\n\n- `DS_ERR_RT_PRECOND` — a go-live pre-condition was not satisfied,\n  e.g. `ds_engine_set_wm_max` was not called first.\n- `DS_ERR_RT_LIVE` — an operation forbidden in LIVE mode was attempted\n : structural changes (loading rules, registering schemas) are\n  INIT-only.\n\n",
